title: F5OS Platform Temperature
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/f5
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the platform inlet/ambient temperature sensors on an F5 Networks
 rSeries appliance running F5OS. Reports the current, average, minimum, and
 maximum temperature readings in degrees Celsius.

discovery:
 One service is created per temperature sensor row in the platform temperature
 table.
